{"connection_id": "BC-af8c20261060dbdca336", "ref": "SBLGNT:2Cor.4.18", "target": "sec9", "tradition": "incil", "kind": "motif", "basis": "Visible things pass, unseen things are eternal", "note": "Paul contrasts visible, temporary things with unseen, eternal things; this makes a concrete temporal-versus-enduring contrast for the commentary's worldly life and better hereafter."}
